ROOT CAUSE FINDING
------------------
The "crypto finalists trade only 6-15 syms" symptom is NOT an engine
gate-block. It is a sweep-harness symbol-list issue.

v8_quick_engine.py defines:
    FAST_SYMBOLS_CRYPTO   = "BTCUSDT,ETHUSDT,SOLUSDT,BNBUSDT,XRPUSDT,
                            ADAUSDT,AVAXUSDT,DOTUSDT,LINKUSDT,LTCUSDT,
                            UNIUSDT,SANDUSDT"   # 12 syms
    MEDIUM_SYMBOLS_CRYPTO = "...same 12 + ATOMUSDT,ALGOUSDT,XLMUSDT,
                            VETUSDT,TRXUSDT,XMRUSDT,ETCUSDT,SUSHIUSDT,
                            MANAUSDT,KSMUSDT,SNXUSDT,YFIUSDT"  # 24 syms

Per CLAUDE.md USDC-OVER-USDT policy, the 10 majors (ETH, BTC, SOL, ADA,
BNB, AVAX, XRP, LINK, LTC, UNI) HAVE NO USDT NPZ — only USDC. iter_npz
silently skips them when symbols=[...USDT...] is requested.

Result: --symbols fast actually loads 2 NPZs (DOTUSDT, SANDUSDT) instead
of the requested 12. --symbols medium loads 14 instead of 24.

The 10 USDC NPZs DO exist (verified):
    ETHUSDC.npz BTCUSDC.npz SOLUSDC.npz ADAUSDC.npz BNBUSDC.npz
    AVAXUSDC.npz XRPUSDC.npz LINKUSDC.npz LTCUSDC.npz UNIUSDC.npz

GATE-PASS AUDIT (crypto_v13_1p7669)
-----------------------------------
For each major USDC NPZ, the entry gates would PASS at these rates
(if the syms were actually loaded):

    LONG  base after all gates : 6.18-7.04% bars  (healthy)
    SHORT base after all gates : 0.00% bars       (broken — but
        the broken gate is RSI_ENTRY_MIN_SHORT=94.5 which affects
        ALL syms, not just majors)

Conclusion: the entry gates DO accept majors. The exclusion is purely
at the harness sym-list level.

PROPOSED FIX (one-line, sweep-safe)
-----------------------------------
Update the FAST/MEDIUM CRYPTO symbol constants so they reference the
correct USDC pair for the 10 majors. This fix replaces only the labels
of the 10 majors. The remaining legacy USDT alts stay USDT.

--- v8_quick_engine.py.orig
+++ v8_quick_engine.py.new
@@ FAST_SYMBOLS_CRYPTO @@
-FAST_SYMBOLS_CRYPTO = "BTCUSDT,ETHUSDT,SOLUSDT,BNBUSDT,XRPUSDT,ADAUSDT,AVAXUSDT,DOTUSDT,LINKUSDT,LTCUSDT,UNIUSDT,SANDUSDT"
+FAST_SYMBOLS_CRYPTO = "BTCUSDC,ETHUSDC,SOLUSDC,BNBUSDC,XRPUSDC,ADAUSDC,AVAXUSDC,DOTUSDT,LINKUSDC,LTCUSDC,UNIUSDC,SANDUSDT"
@@ MEDIUM_SYMBOLS_CRYPTO @@
-MEDIUM_SYMBOLS_CRYPTO = "BTCUSDT,ETHUSDT,SOLUSDT,BNBUSDT,XRPUSDT,ADAUSDT,AVAXUSDT,DOTUSDT,LINKUSDT,LTCUSDT,UNIUSDT,SANDUSDT,ATOMUSDT,ALGOUSDT,XLMUSDT,VETUSDT,TRXUSDT,XMRUSDT,ETCUSDT,SUSHIUSDT,MANAUSDT,KSMUSDT,SNXUSDT,YFIUSDT"
+MEDIUM_SYMBOLS_CRYPTO = "BTCUSDC,ETHUSDC,SOLUSDC,BNBUSDC,XRPUSDC,ADAUSDC,AVAXUSDC,DOTUSDT,LINKUSDC,LTCUSDC,UNIUSDC,SANDUSDT,ATOMUSDT,ALGOUSDT,XLMUSDT,VETUSDT,TRXUSDT,XMRUSDT,ETCUSDT,SUSHIUSDT,MANAUSDT,KSMUSDT,SNXUSDT,YFIUSDT"

This is consistent with the USDC-OVER-USDT mandate in CLAUDE.md.

OPTIONAL: SWEEPABLE INCLUSION KNOB (config-driven, no code edit)
-----------------------------------------------------------------
For sweeping the impact of including majors, add a config knob:

    MAJOR_USDC_INCLUDE_BYPASS_TRADIER: bool = False

The knob does NOT alter entry-gate logic (that already passes majors).
It would alter the sym-list builder so when True the 10 USDC majors
are appended to whatever --symbols list the user passes.

Suggested patch sketch (only touches main()'s sym-list build):

    @@ around line 5547 @@
    syms = None
    if args.symbols == "fast":
        syms = (FAST_SYMBOLS_TRADIER if args.mode == "tradier"
                else FAST_SYMBOLS_CRYPTO).split(",")
    elif args.symbols:
        syms = [s.strip() for s in args.symbols.split(",") if s.strip()]
+   # Sweepable: append the 10 USDC majors when knob is on (crypto only).
+   if args.mode == "crypto" and getattr(cfg, "MAJOR_USDC_INCLUDE_BYPASS_TRADIER", False):
+       _MAJORS = ["BTCUSDC","ETHUSDC","SOLUSDC","ADAUSDC","BNBUSDC",
+                  "AVAXUSDC","XRPUSDC","LINKUSDC","LTCUSDC","UNIUSDC"]
+       if syms is None:
+           syms = _MAJORS
+       else:
+           syms = sorted(set(syms) | set(_MAJORS))

NOT-A-FIX (rejected alternatives)
---------------------------------
- Lower ENTRY_SCORE_THRESHOLD: gates accept majors at ~6-7% — already
  fine. Lowering would just spam entries.
- Bump major-coin priority in ranker: there is no per-sym ranker in
  v8_quick_engine — sym order in stores doesn't affect outcome.
- Add new gate-bypass: gates already pass. No bypass needed.

